{"湖":[["这个湖里有很多鱼。","zhè ge hú lǐ yǒu hěn duō yú ","Fish abound in this lake.","tatoeba:907518"],["湖和河里全是鱼。","hú hé hé lǐ quán shì yú ","The lakes and rivers, too, are full of fish.","tatoeba:10171219"],["在湖边度假。","zài hú biān dù jià ","We had our vacation at the lake.","tatoeba:348613"]],"海":[["鱼在海里。","yú zài hǎi lǐ ","The fish are in the sea.","tatoeba:3377879"],["我是上海人。","wǒ shì shàng hǎi rén ","I'm Shanghainese.","tatoeba:347342"],["他去北海道了。","tā qù běi hǎi dào le ","He has gone to Hokkaido.","tatoeba:833108"]],"地":[["谢天谢地。","xiè tiān xiè dì ","Thank God.","tatoeba:10645538"],["他坐在地上。","tā zuò zài dì shàng ","He was sitting on the floor.","tatoeba:799117"],["他是本地人。","tā shì běn dì rén ","He is a local.","tatoeba:9954763"]],"云":[["那晚多云。","nà wǎn duō yún ","It was cloudy that night.","tatoeba:346116"],["天上没有云。","tiān shàng méi yǒu yún ","There is no cloud in the sky.","tatoeba:335530"],["云开见天日。","yún kāi jiàn tiān rì ","The clouds opened and the sun shone through.","tatoeba:336958"]],"雨":[["不在下雨。","bú zài xià yǔ ","It's not raining.","tatoeba:1366202"],["雨下了一周。","yǔ xià le yì zhōu ","It rained for a week.","tatoeba:333989"],["昨天下很多雨。","zuó tiān xià hěn duō yǔ ","We had a lot of rain yesterday.","tatoeba:907861"]],"雪":[["今天下雪。","jīn tiān xià xuě ","It's snowy today.","tatoeba:776959"],["昨晚下了雪。","zuó wǎn xià le xuě ","It snowed last night.","tatoeba:8800811"],["雪下了一周。","xuě xià le yì zhōu ","It snowed all week.","tatoeba:13504857"]],"风":[["今天有风。","jīn tiān yǒu fēng ","It's windy today.","tatoeba:510694"],["外面风很大。","wài miàn fēng hěn dà ","It's windy outside.","tatoeba:13552173"],["她得了痛风。","tā dé le tòng fēng ","She is affected with the gout.","tatoeba:2411913"]],"雾":[["外面有雾。","wài miàn yǒu wù ","It's foggy out.","tatoeba:13556507"],["今天早上起雾了。","jīn tiān zǎo shàng qǐ wù le ","This morning was foggy.","tatoeba:5957546"],["今天雾很大。","jīn tiān wù hěn dà ","It's quite foggy today.","tatoeba:13556505"]],"冷":[["这里很冷。","zhè lǐ hěn lěng ","It's very cold here.","tatoeba:381930"],