thered.","tatoeba:459394"],["这是花吗？","zhè shì huā ma ","Is this a flower?","tatoeba:1187312"],["我买了花。","wǒ mǎi le huā ","I bought flowers.","tatoeba:11508980"]],"草":[["不要走在草地上。","bú yào zǒu zài cǎo dì shàng ","Stay off the grass.","tatoeba:766952"],["又要马儿好，又要马儿不吃草。","yòu yào mǎ ér hǎo  yòu yào mǎ ér bù chī cǎo ","You want the horse to run fast, but you don't want to feed it grass.","tatoeba:14011829"],["看，一片四叶草！","kàn  yí piàn sì yè cǎo ","Look! A four-leafed clover!","tatoeba:13885386"]],"鸟":[["一石二鸟。","yì shí èr niǎo ","Kill two birds with one stone.","tatoeba:401900"],["鸟在天上。","niǎo zài tiān shàng ","The bird is in the sky.","tatoeba:9096132"],["这儿有只鸟。","zhè ér yǒu zhī niǎo ","There is a bird here.","tatoeba:10563975"]],"虫":[["你是只虫。","nǐ shì zhī chóng ","You're a bug.","tatoeba:1404401"],["你怕虫子吗？","nǐ pà chóng zǐ ma ","Are you afraid of bugs?","tatoeba:4813407"],["\" 我已经长大了不玩虫了\"，这个男孩说。","  wǒ yǐ jīng zhǎng dà le bù wán chóng le   zhè ge nán hái shuō ","\"I'm too old to be playing with bugs,\" said the boy.","tatoeba:917771"]],"狗":[["我没有狗。","wǒ méi yǒu gǒu ","I don't have a dog.","tatoeba:7772409"],["你有四只狗。","nǐ yǒu sì zhī gǒu ","You have four dogs.","tatoeba:558665"],["你们不是狗。","nǐ men bú shì gǒu ","You're not dogs.","tatoeba:1754766"]],"猫":[["我没有猫。","wǒ méi yǒu māo ","I don't have a cat.","tatoeba:407226"],["这是猫吗？","zhè shì māo ma ","Is that a cat?","tatoeba:1123530"],["猫在哪里？","māo zài nǎ lǐ ","Where's the cat?","tatoeba:1851461"]],"马":[["马上上马！","mǎ shàng shàng mǎ ","Get on the horse immediately!","tatoeba:2220573"],["这只是马。","zhè zhǐ shì mǎ ","This is only a horse.","tatoeba:2561557"],["他们有马。","tā men yǒu mǎ ","They have a horse.","tatoeba:5640763"]],"牛":[["没牛奶了。","méi niú nǎi le ","There's no more milk.","tatoeba:345919"],["我有一头母牛。","wǒ yǒu yì tóu mǔ niú ","I have a cow.","tatoeba:2777842"],["\"我也要牛肉。\""," wǒ yě yào niú ròu  ","I want beef, too.","tatoeba:780397"]],"羊":[["比起羊肉我更喜欢牛肉。","bǐ qǐ yáng ròu wǒ gèng xǐ huan niú ròu ","I like beef more than lamb.","tatoeb